{"seq":2,"slug":"service-catalog","title":"服务目录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/service-catalog","wordCount":714,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务目录\">服务目录</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>服务目录（Service Catalog）是开发者门户的核心数据层。它为组织中的所有软件资产——服务、库、API、文档、基础设施组件——建立一个统一的、可搜索的注册中心。服务目录回答的核心问题是：&quot;这个服务是谁的？它做什么？怎么用？健康状况如何？&quot;</p>\n<p>在微服务架构下，一个中型组织可能有数百个服务。没有服务目录，开发者面临的常见困境包括：不知道某个功能对应哪个服务、找不到服务的负责人、不清楚服务间的依赖关系。服务目录通过结构化元数据解决这些问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 数据源&#10;        A[Git 仓库]&#10;        B[Kubernetes 集群]&#10;        C[CI/CD 系统]&#10;        D[监控系统]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 服务目录&#10;        E[实体注册]&#10;        F[关系图谱]&#10;        G[元数据索引]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 消费者&#10;        H[开发者搜索]&#10;        I[依赖分析]&#10;        J[合规审计]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; J\">graph TB\n    subgraph 数据源\n        A[Git 仓库]\n        B[Kubernetes 集群]\n        C[CI/CD 系统]\n        D[监控系统]\n    end\n    subgraph 服务目录\n        E[实体注册]\n        F[关系图谱]\n        G[元数据索引]\n    end\n    subgraph 消费者\n        H[开发者搜索]\n        I[依赖分析]\n        J[合规审计]\n    end\n    A --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>无服务目录</th>\n<th>Confluence/Wiki</th>\n<th>自动化服务目录</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>服务发现</td>\n<td>问同事</td>\n<td>搜索文档</td>\n<td>一键搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负责人查找</td>\n<td>查 Git blame</td>\n<td>文档中记录</td>\n<td>实时关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖关系</td>\n<td>手动梳理</td>\n<td>手动维护图</td>\n<td>自动生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据新鲜度</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>经常过时</td>\n<td>实时同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 文档</td>\n<td>散落各处</td>\n<td>集中但手动</td>\n<td>自动聚合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实体模型与元数据管理\">实体模型与元数据管理</h2><p>Backstage 的服务目录基于实体模型（Entity Model），每个软件资产都是一个实体。实体通过 <code>catalog-info.yaml</code> 文件定义，存放在对应的 Git 仓库中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# catalog-info.yaml：服务实体定义&#10;apiVersion: backstage.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Component&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-service&#10;  description: 订单管理服务，处理订单创建、支付和履约&#10;  annotations:&#10;    github.com/project-slug: my-org/order-service&#10;    backstage.io/techdocs-ref: dir:.&#10;    grafana/dashboard-url: https://grafana.example.com/d/order-service&#10;    pagerduty.com/service-id: P1234567&#10;  tags:&#10;    - typescript&#10;    - grpc&#10;    - critical&#10;  links:&#10;    - url: https://wiki.example.com/order-service&#10;      title: 设计文档&#10;      icon: docs&#10;spec:&#10;  type: service&#10;  lifecycle: production&#10;  owner: order-team&#10;  system: e-commerce&#10;  providesApis:&#10;    - order-api&#10;  consumesApis:&#10;    - payment-api&#10;    - inventory-api&#10;  dependsOn:&#10;    - resource:order-db&#10;    - resource:order-cache\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># catalog-info.yaml：服务实体定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">backstage.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">订单管理服务，处理订单创建、支付和履约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    github.com/project-slug</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-org/order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    backstage.io/techdocs-ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dir:.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    grafana/dashboard-url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://grafana.example.com/d/order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pagerduty.com/service-id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">P1234567</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">typescript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">grpc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  links</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://wiki.example.com/order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">设计文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      icon</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lifecycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  system</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">e-commerce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  providesApis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  consumesApis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">inventory-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  dependsOn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resource:order-db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resource:order-cache</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EntityKinds {&#10;  Component: {&#10;    description: &#39;软件组件（服务、前端、库）&#39;;&#10;    types: [&#39;service&#39;, &#39;website&#39;, &#39;library&#39;];&#10;    required: [&#39;name&#39;, &#39;owner&#39;, &#39;type&#39;, &#39;lifecycle&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  API: {&#10;    description: &#39;API 定义（REST、gRPC、GraphQL、事件）&#39;;&#10;    types: [&#39;openapi&#39;, &#39;grpc&#39;, &#39;graphql&#39;, &#39;asyncapi&#39;];&#10;    required: [&#39;name&#39;, &#39;owner&#39;, &#39;type&#39;, &#39;definition&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  Resource: {&#10;    description: &#39;基础设施资源（数据库、队列、存储）&#39;;&#10;    types: [&#39;database&#39;, &#39;cache&#39;, &#39;queue&#39;, &#39;storage&#39;];&#10;    required: [&#39;name&#39;, &#39;owner&#39;, &#39;type&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  System: {&#10;    description: &#39;相关组件的逻辑分组&#39;;&#10;    example: &#39;电商系统 = 订单服务 + 支付服务 + 库存服务&#39;;&#10;    required: [&#39;name&#39;, &#39;owner&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  Group: {&#10;    description: &#39;团队或组织单元&#39;;&#10;    source: &#39;LDAP/Okta 自动同步&#39;;&#10;    required: [&#39;name&#39;, &#39;type&#39;, &#39;children&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  User: {&#10;    description: &#39;个人用户&#39;;&#10;    source: &#39;LDAP/Okta 自动同步&#39;;&#10;    required: [&#39;name&#39;, &#39;memberOf&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EntityKinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  Component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '软件组件（服务、前端、库）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    types</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;