span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    coverage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'有 catalog-info.yaml 的仓库占比'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    completeness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'平均元数据完整度评分'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    freshness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'最后更新时间 > 90天的实体比例'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    orphans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'无有效 owner 的实体数量'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    coverage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'> 95%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    completeness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'> 80 分'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    freshness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'> 90% 在90天内更新'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    orphans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C; 5%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    low_coverage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'在 CI 中强制要求 catalog-info.yaml'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    low_completeness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'展示实体评分排名，激励团队完善'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    stale_entities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'自动发送提醒到 owner'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    orphans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'定期清理会议'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>服务目录治理的核心理念是&quot;数据即产品&quot;——像对待面向用户的产品数据一样对待目录数据，持续监控其质量并及时修复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((服务目录))&#10;    实体模型&#10;      Component&#10;      API&#10;      Resource&#10;      System&#10;      Group/User&#10;    元数据管理&#10;      catalog-info.yaml&#10;      CI 校验&#10;      完整度评分&#10;    依赖可视化&#10;      上下游分析&#10;      影响评估&#10;      声明+运行时&#10;    目录治理&#10;      数据质量&#10;      生命周期&#10;      孤儿检测\">mindmap\n  root((服务目录))\n    实体模型\n      Component\n      API\n      Resource\n      System\n      Group/User\n    元数据管理\n      catalog-info.yaml\n      CI 校验\n      完整度评分\n    依赖可视化\n      上下游分析\n      影响评估\n      声明+运行时\n    目录治理\n      数据质量\n      生命周期\n      孤儿检测</pre><ul>\n<li>服务目录为所有软件资产建立统一、可搜索的注册中心</li>\n<li>实体模型包括 Component、API、Resource、System、Group/User 六种类型</li>\n<li>通过 catalog-info.yaml 声明元数据，CI 检查确保数据质量</li>\n<li>依赖可视化结合声明式（catalog-info）和运行时（Service Mesh/Tracing）数据</li>\n<li>数据治理是目录长期价值的保障——覆盖率、完整度、新鲜度是核心指标</li>\n<li>将目录数据视为产品，持续监控质量并及时修复</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服务目录","id":"服务目录"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实体模型与元数据管理","id":"实体模型与元数据管理"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖可视化与影响分析","id":"依赖可视化与影响分析"},{"level":2,"text":"服务目录治理","id":"服务目录治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开发者门户架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/developer-portal-architecture"},"next":{"title":"API 文档平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/developer-portal/api-documentation-platform"}}